---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout 
  title="Introduction — Aster Design System"
  description="Aster Design System is a token-first, zero-dependency design system designed to provide one authoritative source of truth with dual human and agent interfaces."
>
  <div style="max-width: 820px;">
    <!-- Title & Overview -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--as-semantic-color-border-subtle); padding-bottom: 24px;">
      <div style="font-family: var(--as-typography-font-family-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-subtle); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 8px;">
        Getting Started
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        Introduction
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-muted); margin: 0;">
        Aster DS is a token-first, zero-dependency design system engineered to deliver a single authoritative source of truth with dual interfaces for developers and AI coding agents.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dual Interfaces -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 16px;">Dual Human & Agent Interfaces</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-muted); margin: 0 0 16px;">
        Unlike traditional design systems built exclusively for human engineers, Aster provides paired human and agent documentation:
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-muted); font-size: 14.5px;">
        <li><strong style="color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-default);">Human-Facing Interface:</strong> Interactive documentation, component playgrounds, and zero-framework HTML/CSS patterns in <code>docs/</code>, <code>components/</code>, and <code>apps/docs/</code>.</li>
        <li><strong style="color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-default);">Agent-Facing Interface:</strong> Machine-readable design tokens, component contracts, and structured coding skills in <code>AGENTS.md</code> and <code>skills/</code>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Canonical Source of Truth -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 16px;">Canonical Source of Truth</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--as-semantic-color-text-muted); margin: 0 0 16px;">
        Aster enforces strict unidirectional compilation from source files to distribution outputs:
      </p>
      <div style="background: var(--as-semantic-color-surface-card); border: 1px solid var(--as-semantic-color-border-subtle); border-radius: var(--as-radius-md); padding: 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
        <div><strong>• Design Tokens Source:</strong> <code>tokens/**/*.json</code> (W3C DTCG format)</div>
        <div><strong>• Component Source:</strong> <code>components/&lt;component&gt;/*.&#123;js,css&#125;</code> and <code>components/base/base.css</code></div>
        <div><strong>• Distribution Outputs:</strong> <code>dist/css/tokens.css</code>, <code>dist/css/components.css</code>, <code>dist/css/aster.css</code>, and <code>dist/js/aster.js</code></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Navigation footer -->
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--as-semantic-color-border-subtle); padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 48px;">
      <div></div>
      <a href="/docs/tokens" class="as-button as-button--secondary" style="text-decoration: none;">
        <span class="as-button__label">Next: Design Tokens</span>
        <i class="ph ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
